{"title": "学前课 “人生的智慧”是什么？", "index": 5, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body>\n<div class=\"vertical-middle\">\n<h2 class=\"section\">学前课</h2>\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">“人生的智慧”是什么？</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-middle\">\n<p class=\"bodycontent-preface\">幸福不是一件容易的事！既不能自发产生，也很难在别人那获得。</p>\n<p class=\"inscribe\">——尚福尔<sup><a href=\"part0059.xhtml#footnote_5\" id=\"noteref_5\">5</a></sup></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-middle\">\n<div class=\"bodypic-c-80\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"../Images/image00103.jpeg\"/></div>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}